+## Sales (schema 3)
+
+Schema 3 adds `sales` and the `sale` id sequence; schema 2 files migrate
+with an empty sales history. Each sale row stores id, ticket, soldAt (UTC
+instant), dishId, qty (whole portions), and the scaled ingredients used.
+Ingredient snapshots preserve theoretical use when recipes change. A ticket
+is imported once, and a whole file commits atomically with its consume
+movements. Sales consume stock in FEFO order with ref `sale:<ticket>`.
